# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. A deactivating activation admits no call, even an interleaving one, so a split waiting on one never finishes.
MODULE: DeactivationWhileBusy
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a leaf begins deactivating while a split on it still waits for an inbound call
PERTURBS: Deactivate

--- FIND
    /\ DeactivationOnlyWhenIdle => ~Running(l)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: deactivation does not wait for the leaf to be idle
    /\ TRUE
--- END
